# # /prism-specification/
#
# https://w3id.org/prism-specification/ redirects to the PRISM specification repository
# https://github.com/MRI-Lab-Graz/prism-specification
#
# A term (https://w3id.org/prism-specification/terms/<modality>/<local-id>) redirects to its JSON file
# in that repository (the raw file). A survey ID has no file of its own; it redirects to the list of released survey IDs.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Karl Koschutnig
# karl.koschutnig@uni-graz.at
# GitHub username: karl-koschutnig

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^terms/survey/[a-z0-9][a-z0-9.-]*$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MRI-Lab-Graz/prism-specification/main/ids/survey-ids.txt [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^terms/([a-z0-9-]+)/([a-z0-9][a-z0-9.-]*)$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MRI-Lab-Graz/prism-specification/main/terms/$1/$2.json [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^ https://github.com/MRI-Lab-Graz/prism-specification [R=302,L]
